# Never committed. The repo is public; this is not a soft rule.
.env
ebay_rest.json
arb.db
arb.db-wal
arb.db-shm

# Reference data is cloned, not vendored. Anchored with a leading slash so it
# matches only the repo-root clone target (Settings.data_dir), NOT src/arb/data/,
# which holds the versioned fee tables. Unanchored, this silently excluded them:
# a fresh clone had no fee tables, and `fee_table_version` pointed at a file with
# no history, which defeats the whole point of stamping it onto every score.
/data/

